<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Check Payment Remittance Slip</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    font-family: "Liberation Sans", "DejaVu Sans", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #000;
  }

  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }

  /* Header */
  .header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .logo-box {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    border-right: 2px solid #ccc;
    padding-right: 14px;
    margin-right: 14px;
  }

  .logo-csun {
    font-family: "Liberation Serif", "DejaVu Serif", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #cc0000;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-right: 10px;
  }

  .logo-text {
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #333;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .university-cash-services {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .title {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    font-family: "Liberation Serif", "DejaVu Serif", Georgia, serif;
  }

  .contact-info {
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    margin: 10px 0;
  }

  /* Section I */
  .section-i {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 13px;
    flex-wrap: nowrap;
  }

  .section-i .field-underline {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    display: inline-block;
    min-width: 120px;
    height: 18px;
    vertical-align: bottom;
  }

  .section-i .field-underline-name {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    display: inline-block;
    min-width: 220px;
    height: 18px;
    vertical-align: bottom;
  }

  .section-i .field-underline-date {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    display: inline-block;
    min-width: 80px;
    height: 18px;
    vertical-align: bottom;
  }

  /* Payment rows */
  .payment-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    font-size: 13px;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .payment-row .amount-line {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    display: inline-block;
    min-width: 180px;
    height: 18px;
    vertical-align: bottom;
  }

  .payment-row .check-line {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    display: inline-block;
    min-width: 150px;
    height: 18px;
    vertical-align: bottom;
  }

  /* Section II */
  .section-ii {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    font-size: 13px;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .section-ii-label {
    font-weight: bold;
    white-space: nowrap;
    padding-top: 2px;
  }

  .section-ii-address {
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.7;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Section III */
  .section-iii {
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .section-iii span.italic {
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Warning */
  .warning {
    color: #cc0000;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin: 18px 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Bullet list */
  .bullet-list {
    list-style-type: disc;
    padding-left: 28px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .bullet-list li {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  /* Rev note */
  .rev-note {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 30px;
    right: 60px;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #555;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="header">
    <div class="logo-box">
      <div class="logo-csun">CSUN</div>
      <div class="logo-text">CALIFORNIA<br>STATE UNIVERSITY<br>NORTHRIDGE</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="university-cash-services">UNIVERSITY CASH SERVICES</div>

  <div class="title">Check Payment Remittance Slip</div>

  <!-- Contact Info -->
  <div class="contact-info">
    <span data-field="office_location">{{ office_location }}</span><br>
    Phone: <span data-field="office_phone">{{ office_phone }}</span><br>
    <br>
    Fax: <span data-field="office_fax">{{ office_fax }}</span><br>
    Mail Code: <span data-field="mail_code">{{ mail_code }}</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Section I -->
  <div class="section-i">
    <span><strong>I.CSUN Student ID:</strong></span>
    <span class="field-underline"><span data-field="student_id">{{ student_id }}</span></span>
    <span><strong>Name:</strong> <em>(Last, First, MI)</em></span>
    <span class="field-underline-name"><span data-field="student_name">{{ student_name }}</span></span>
    <span><strong>Date:</strong></span>
    <span class="field-underline-date"><span data-field="submission_date">{{ submission_date }}</span></span>
  </div>

  <!-- Tuition Row -->
  <div class="payment-row">
    Please pay <strong><em>TUITION</em></strong> amount: $
    <span class="amount-line"><span data-field="tuition_amount">{{ tuition_amount }}</span></span>
    &nbsp;&nbsp; With a <strong><em>PERSONAL CHECK #</em></strong>:
    <span class="check-line"><span data-field="personal_check_number">{{ personal_check_number }}</span></span>
  </div>

  <!-- Housing Row -->
  <div class="payment-row">
    Please pay <strong><em>HOUSING</em></strong> amount: $
    <span class="amount-line"><span data-field="housing_amount">{{ housing_amount }}</span></span>
    &nbsp;&nbsp; With a <strong><em>CASHIER'S CHECK #</em></strong>:
    <span class="check-line"><span data-field="cashiers_check_number">{{ cashiers_check_number }}</span></span>
  </div>

  <!-- Meal Plan Row -->
  <div class="payment-row">
    Please pay <strong><em>MEAL PLAN</em></strong> amount: $
    <span class="amount-line"><span data-field="meal_plan_amount">{{ meal_plan_amount }}</span></span>
    &nbsp;&nbsp; With a <strong><em>MONEY ORDER #</em></strong>:
    <span class="check-line"><span data-field="money_order_number">{{ money_order_number }}</span></span>
  </div>

  <!-- Section II -->
  <div class="section-ii">
    <div class="section-ii-label"><strong>II.MAIL PAYMENT TO:</strong></div>
    <div class="section-ii-address">
      <span data-field="mail_to.university_name">{{ mail_to.university_name }}</span><br>
      <span data-field="mail_to.department">{{ mail_to.department }}</span><br>
      <span data-field="mail_to.street_address">{{ mail_to.street_address }}</span><br>
      <span data-field="mail_to.city_state_zip">{{ mail_to.city_state_zip }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Section III -->
  <div class="section-iii">
    <strong>III.MAKE YOUR CHECK OR MONEY ORDER PAYABLE TO:</strong>&nbsp;
    <span class="italic"><span data-field="payable_to">{{ payable_to }}</span></span>
  </div>

  <!-- Warning -->
  <div class="warning">
    PAYMENT IS NOT CONSIDERED RECEIVED UNTIL IT IS POSTED TO THE STUDENT ACCOUNT.
  </div>

  <!-- Bullet Points -->
  <ul class="bullet-list">
    <li>CSUN <strong>does not</strong> accept overpayments to student accounts. Checks written for amounts more than the current balance due on a student account will be returned to sender, putting the student at risk for disenrollment if the correct payment amount is not received by the payment deadline.</li>
    <li>To avoid the consequences of a late payment, mail your payment at least ten (10) days prior to the due date.</li>
    <li>A postmark on the day the payment is due is <strong>NOT</strong> accepted as a timely statement.</li>
    <li>Next day delivery methods <strong>DO NOT</strong> guarantee posting to a student's account, but rather delivery to the university mail room for routing. Allow <strong>TWO (2)</strong> days for posting.</li>
    <li>The university is not responsible for delayed or lost mail.</li>
  </ul>

  <!-- Rev note -->
  <div class="rev-note">REV: <span data-field="revision_date">{{ revision_date }}</span></div>

</div>
</body>
</html>